To address these challenges,
we built an AutoML-based Edge

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:05.760
object tracking solution,
deployed on Google Coral IoT

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:09.180
gateway to tracking assets
and final assembly worker

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:12.810
movements within an
outside assembly stations,

00:15:12.810 --> 00:15:16.710
maintaining the privacy of
worker images on the Edge

00:15:16.710 --> 00:15:19.530
and transmitting only the
segmented data to the Cloud,

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:21.570
thereby alerting
supervisors when

00:15:21.570 --> 00:15:26.550
bottlenecks or out-of-balance
conditions were detected.

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:28.660
And for our life
sciences clients,

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:32.090
we developed an autonomous
Google visual inspection

00:15:32.090 --> 00:15:34.510
solution to analyze
bacteria samples

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:37.340
and assess different quality
types before carrying out

00:15:37.340 --> 00:15:39.050
advanced research.

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:41.330
Here, a programmed
robotic arm picks up

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:45.430
Petri dishes with samples that
have to undergo quality check

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:49.000
and places them under a camera
integrated with an H gateway

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:51.190
running AI visual
inspection models,

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:53.800
analyzing these
samples in real time

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:56.470
and then instructing these
robotic arms to place

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:58.900
the different quality
categories of bacterias

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:01.070
into a designated pit.

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:03.130
The value we were
able to provide here

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:08.170
is to effectively utilize lab
technician's time for higher

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:11.650
value tasks and let AI do
the mundane type of quality

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:15.130
inspection checks, thereby
reducing inspection

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:19.240
time by 80% through
automation, as well reducing

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:22.632
the false positive rates by 10%.

00:16:22.632 --> 00:16:26.770
For retail, we built an AI and
IoT driven visual inspection

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:30.890
solution on Google Cloud AI
platform and Google Coral

00:16:30.890 --> 00:16:32.710
with the camera
tracking inventory

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:37.660
levels of these promotional
shelves items in real time.

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:40.940
Simultaneously, we
also carried out

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:44.280
performing planogram
compliance checks.

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:47.160
And this inspected
data alerted workers

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:50.790
to take actions before they turn
into real business problems.

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:54.190
With this, we were able to
bring inventory automation,

00:16:54.190 --> 00:16:56.970
overcoming out of
inventory scenarios

00:16:56.970 --> 00:17:01.130
efficiently by utilization and
improved customer experience.

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:05.880
Another valuable experience
we conducted at retail

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:09.150
is measuring customer
behavior in store.

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:13.140
And this is to optimize in-store
customer experience with better

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:14.890
services and operations.

00:17:14.890 --> 00:17:18.210
And all of this is done with
a privacy-first mindset,

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:21.480
processing customer
visual data on the Edge.

